flowchart TB
  U[User] --> UI[Workspace UI<br/>left: files · middle: chat · right: trace]

  UI --> ORCH[Context Orchestrator<br/>拼接规则/预算/缺口检测]
  ORCH --> L1[Layer1 Identity<br/>user.md project.md lab_context.md]
  ORCH --> L2[Layer2 Timeline<br/>phase/week/day/stage_reports]
  ORCH --> L3[Layer3 Yard Notes<br/>Concept · Task · Pack]
  ORCH --> SK[Skills Snapshot<br/>skills/registry + selected skill.md]
  ORCH --> UP[Uploads<br/>csv/png/pdf paths + metadata]

  ORCH --> LLM[LLM + Tools]
  LLM --> FS[File Store<br/>workspace instance (唯一真源)]
  LLM --> TR[.openclaw/context_trace/Txxxx.json<br/>读/写/缺/工具回放]

  TPL[workspace-templates (模具)] -.init/clone.-> FS